Why this module is the largest

In enterprise insurance systems, a policy is a long-lived legal contract that evolves over time. Rather than updating a single row, the platform preserves every endorsement, renewal, ownership change, premium adjustment, document version, and lifecycle event. This ensures regulatory compliance, complete auditability, historical reconstruction, and accurate financial reporting while allowing policies to span many years.

This module is the central business domain of InsureIQ. Claims, Billing, Commissions, AI Risk Scoring, Customer Portals, Marketplace synchronization, Analytics, and Reporting all reference policy_id.
