Why Billing is a separate domain

Enterprise insurance systems isolate billing from policy administration because premium collection has its own financial rules, payment integrations, tax calculations, accounting requirements, reconciliation processes, and regulatory controls. A policy may remain unchanged while multiple invoices, installment schedules, payments, refunds, and reconciliations occur over its lifetime. Separating these concerns improves scalability, auditability, and integration with ERP/accounting systems.

This module provides the financial backbone for InsureIQ and integrates closely with Policy Management, Claims (for claim payouts and recoveries), Commission Management, Finance, Reporting, and external payment gateways.

